<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge fell to 75.5000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge fell to 75.5000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 75.1500 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Feb 21		  Feb 20</p>
<p> High			     75.1550		 75.1000</p>
<p> Low				75.5000		 75.7400</p>
<p> Open			     75.1550		 75.1000</p>
<p> Close			    75.5000		 75.1500</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    2.960		  16.625</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Feb 21		  Feb 20</p>
<p> High			     44.9000		 44.6500</p>
